# The corpus is its generator. Generated data, ground truth, and raw scanner
# outputs contain pattern-true FAKE credentials, and GitHub's push protection
# (correctly) refuses pattern-faithful fakes - which both keeps forks pushable
# and independently confirms the fakes' fidelity. Reproduce locally:
#   node corpus/generate.js && node harness/run.js --all && node harness/score.js
